    "long_instructions": "#### Write a clear headline and button\r\n\r\n1. Ask the AI to make your headline say what your site is for.\r\n2. Ask the AI to make your button tell a visitor what to do next.\r\n3. Look at your page like a first-time visitor. If it's not clear what the site is for or what to do, tell the AI what to fix.\r\n\r\n*Example: “Make the headline say ‘Join the Robotics Club.’ Make the button say ‘Sign up today.’”*",
